1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,980
Most people think that becoming consistent requires more

2
00:00:02,980 --> 00:00:03,480
discipline.

3
00:00:03,920 --> 00:00:04,460
It doesn't.

4
00:00:04,700 --> 00:00:06,280
It requires a smaller promise.

5
00:00:06,740 --> 00:00:08,400
If you tell yourself you will work out

6
00:00:08,400 --> 00:00:10,560
for an hour every day, your brain treats

7
00:00:10,560 --> 00:00:12,340
that as a threat, and it will find

8
00:00:12,340 --> 00:00:13,500
a reason to avoid it.

9
00:00:13,680 --> 00:00:15,880
But if you promise yourself just 5 minutes,

10
00:00:16,340 --> 00:00:17,700
something interesting happens.

11
00:00:18,180 --> 00:00:19,240
You actually start.

12
00:00:19,620 --> 00:00:21,020
And starting is the hard part.

